description:
Sometimes you can’t use `system2` to execute a command safely.

a shell transformer is nothing but the following, but is arguably more useful than `glue_sql`.

```r
shell_transformer <- function(type = c("sh", "csh", "cmd", "cmd2")) {
  function(code, envir) shQuote(glue::evaluate(code, envir), type)
}
```

```
cat_string <- function(x) {
  stopifnot(is.character(x))
  
  structure(x, class = "cat_string")
}

print.cat_string <- function(x, ..., sep = "\n") {
  cat(x, ..., sep = sep)
}
```
